##  Business Problem Statement – Customer Shopping Behaviour Analysis

In today's competitive retail market, understanding customer shopping behaviour is essential for improving sales, customer satisfaction, and business growth. The business has collected customer shopping data, including demographics, product preferences, purchase frequency, subscription status, discounts, shipping methods, and customer reviews. However, without proper analysis, it is difficult to identify customer purchasing patterns, understand revenue contributions, and evaluate the effectiveness of promotional strategies.
The objective of this project is to analyze customer shopping behaviour using Python, MySQL, and Power BI to identify key business insights and provide data-driven recommendations.
